@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L1：二期可靠发送总览

actor Biz as "业务代码"
participant "MessageTemplate" as Template
participant "PreparedMessageSend" as Prepared
participant "MessageSendExecutor" as Executor
participant "DefaultReliableMessageSender" as Sender
participant "RetryExecutor\n(retry-component)" as Retry
participant "MessageSendRetryClassifier" as Classifier
participant "MessageProvider" as Provider
queue "Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ4" as Broker
participant "SendResult" as Result

Biz -> Template: send(destination, envelope)
Template -> Template: validate / enrich / resolve / serialize
Template -> Prepared: create immutable prepared send
Template -> Executor: send(prepared)
Executor -> Sender: send(prepared)
Sender -> Retry: execute(RetryExecution<ProviderSendResult>)

loop attempt <= maxAttempts && within maxDuration
  Retry -> Sender: execute attempt
  Sender -> Provider: provider.send(request)
  Provider -> Broker: native publish
  Broker --> Provider: ack / reject / timeout / error
  Provider --> Sender: ProviderSendResult
  Retry -> Classifier: classify(attempt result)
  Classifier --> Retry: SUCCESS / RETRY / STOP / ABORT
end

Retry --> Sender: RetryResult
Sender -> Result: map RetryResult + ProviderSendResult
Result --> Template: SendResult(status, failureType, reliabilityInfo)
Template --> Biz: SendResult

note over Classifier
UNKNOWN 默认 STOP，不继续重试。
原因：Broker 可能已经收到消息，直接重试可能产生重复业务消息。
end note
@enduml
